Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,广大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是干嘛的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我也发现时就在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太太
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,佐川先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在路上突然被袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.73,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,被拉上车
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,死掉了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,市野
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,认识的人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是我老公
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎各位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:05:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在开始要发布重要讯息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,各位只要达到一个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以从这里出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在24小时内没完成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就会被射杀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那么各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请享受生死决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,（不做爱的话）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,（就无法）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,（从这里出去）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（必须要100次的绝顶 才能逃出房间）\N（因为无法让老婆高潮的我）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,（只好把她交给一起被监禁的绝伦男人）\N（一乃葵）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是保险套 他们是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要不要试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,或许门会开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你相信吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才都这么说了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你们是夫妻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,做爱有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.47,0:07:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在学生面前我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得太太是老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是学生吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔是老师的朋友吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是大叔是老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他是工务所老板是我的客户
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那他呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是住在我隔壁的邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是町田
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,町田啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:07:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,佐川先生会不会是跟他们一伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种状况下那么冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,工务所的工人要做这种东西很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那个町田也很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会就是犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想把我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在别的房间里参加游戏的男女
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不听我们的指示所以被射杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,各位都被监视着？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,枪口已经对着各位了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快点好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,广大也要拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可以先拜托妳吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,知道要怎么做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.07,0:10:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要放进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快点结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多结束了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,射了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.55,0:13:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来好多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,市野大地先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,过关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可以从笼子里出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,佐川你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.66,0:14:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么佐川 是佐川先生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要加先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可不能只让你们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,女人只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还用说吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要跟你老婆做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,才能从这里出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不做爱就出不去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才跟我做爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,把小葵从笼子里放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一乃葵小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有过关
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.13,0:15:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,老公做爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,妳却没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,请看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,上面的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从100减少到99
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么的数字呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,做做看就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,听他的话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,妳有可能会被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要改变状况
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去妳也会被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 老公
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不会让妳白白牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会努力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 快点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可以不要吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,反正要做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就愉快一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妳这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,享受过我的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,今后可能老公的就没办法让妳高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,妳比想像中还兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:18:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,老公在那看着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看看呼吸开始急促了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都已经湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.31,0:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都不诚实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的老师胸部好大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,妳平常也是这么认为吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,老师有这样的胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,男学生会伤脑筋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好淫荡的乳头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.45,0:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,老师的小穴好香
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要看啰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很害羞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.81,0:22:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.75,0:22:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔 那就快点看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,淫荡的小穴张这么开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.93,0:22:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,张好开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还流出爱液
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.34,0:23:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可以叫出声来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.65,0:25:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,张开一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.55,0:26:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再多感受一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.31,0:26:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,用小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.18,0:27:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好湿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.42,0:27:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,把屁股转向我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.86,0:27:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.17,0:27:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看不到老公的脸这样比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.69,0:28:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也很敏感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,张好开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.15,0:29:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.34,0:30:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,起来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.60,0:30:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,摸我的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.14,0:30:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.51,0:30:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这只肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.82,0:30:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.35,0:30:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,跟老公的比
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.32,0:30:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请你快一点好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,想快一点看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.83,0:30:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.26,0:31:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再放进去一点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.08,0:31:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,难过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.48,0:32:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.05,0:32:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一起舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.52,0:32:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样比较有气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.83,0:34:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.73,0:34:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来插入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.60,0:34:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,直接放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.21,0:34:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请戴上套子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.11,0:34:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.38,0:34:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.66,0:34:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不戴套比较舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.50,0:34:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.51,0:34:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看我有戴套子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.54,0:34:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.78,0:35:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.35,0:35:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.70,0:36:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.15,0:37:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可以叫出声来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.01,0:38:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.78,0:38:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,张开眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.50,0:38:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,手靠着
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没发挥我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.34,0:39:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股翘高
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.23,0:43:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妳有着很棒的小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.64,0:43:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.97,0:43:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请赶快射
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.31,0:43:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了妳在忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.47,0:43:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.07,0:43:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好好的看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.59,0:44:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.72,0:44:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我快忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.00,0:44:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再忍一下比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还是射出来比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.14,0:44:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,请射出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.58,0:45:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就射了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.72,0:45:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实射了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.96,0:46:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,醒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.06,0:46:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,托太太的福
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.46,0:46:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟妳可以从笼子里出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.63,0:46:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我还找到了水和食物
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.85,0:46:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.42,0:46:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.46,0:46:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.09,0:46:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.06,0:46:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.60,0:46:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.87,0:47:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,先救我们自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.94,0:47:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.72,0:47:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 打不开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.52,0:47:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.53,0:47:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,从房子里出去的条件未达成
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.71,0:47:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.85,0:47:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.79,0:47:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.55,0:47:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要救那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.69,0:47:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,妳在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.16,0:47:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.99,0:48:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才不是要我跟佐川先生做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.30,0:48:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为了要救妳
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.07,0:48:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.27,0:48:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想救那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.22,0:48:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想办法救你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.09,0:48:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.09,0:48:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.61,0:48:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.79,0:49:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,老师真的可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.06,0:49:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想救你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.37,0:49:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.31,0:49:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.67,0:49:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,交给老师
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.08,0:50:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.66,0:50:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他是妳的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.73,0:50:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.28,0:51:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.52,0:51:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.09,0:51:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,老师想射了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.29,0:51:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.55,0:51:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.07,0:52:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.11,0:52:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以继续吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.98,0:52:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.75,0:52:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也让我舒服好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.09,0:52:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.86,0:52:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵妳在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.87,0:52:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.73,0:52:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.30,0:52:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.74,0:54:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,手指
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.64,0:54:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,放进去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.70,0:55:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.40,0:55:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.02,0:55:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那里再多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.78,0:55:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.76,0:55:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.49,0:55:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.92,0:56:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有套子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.99,0:56:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵妳在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.03,0:56:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.36,0:56:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他是妳的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.24,0:57:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.84,0:57:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.37,0:57:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.41,0:57:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,可是不做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.01,0:57:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就出不去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.35,0:57:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.12,0:57:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.81,0:57:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,放进来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.47,0:58:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.14,0:58:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.35,0:58:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.51,0:59:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.31,0:59:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,给我多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.68,0:59:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.13,1:00:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,居然要做到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.34,1:01:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我多一点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.11,1:01:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.60,1:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要再多一点吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.86,1:01:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,多一点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.31,1:02:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很快会想射
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.42,1:02:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.46,1:02:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.50,1:02:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想射了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.83,1:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.20,1:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.33,1:03:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来好多喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.07,1:03:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,换我了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.07,1:03:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要跟你做
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.44,1:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.35,1:03:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.68,1:03:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.52,1:03:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.02,1:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是不要跟你做
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.05,1:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.06,1:03:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵她不愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听见吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.49,1:03:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.63,1:03:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,想出去对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.96,1:03:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她不想
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.33,1:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你别碰她
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.90,1:03:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.70,1:03:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只留下我吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.81,1:03:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.44,1:03:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你别再碰她
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.01,1:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.68,1:03:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.08,1:03:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.22,1:04:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这样太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.99,1:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.39,1:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有听见吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.26,1:04:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这状况太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.93,1:04:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.11,1:04:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.95,1:04:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你住手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.68,1:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.25,1:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.16,1:04:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.02,1:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.46,1:05:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.49,1:05:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,妳去了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我就会出不去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.37,1:05:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.85,1:05:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要我绝对不要
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.78,1:05:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.48,1:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.75,1:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.99,1:05:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点放开她
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.26,1:05:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.36,1:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.39,1:05:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.66,1:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.54,1:06:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.81,1:06:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.12,1:06:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是够了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.59,1:06:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.21,1:06:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.04,1:06:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.21,1:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.35,1:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.65,1:06:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.09,1:06:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.53,1:06:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.06,1:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.88,1:07:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.25,1:07:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是去了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.82,1:07:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.79,1:07:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再这样了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.96,1:07:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能忍
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.23,1:07:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快放手
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.30,1:07:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.21,1:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.30,1:08:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想射了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.13,1:08:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不能射在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.90,1:08:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,里面不行
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.17,1:08:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.27,1:08:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,里面不行
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.22,1:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,到底在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.51,1:09:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这下子就搞清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.32,1:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,左边的数字
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.62,1:09:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是让她去的次数
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.66,1:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里所谓的做爱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.50,1:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是让对方高潮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.10,1:09:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,自己也得高潮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.57,1:09:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就算去一次
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.70,1:09:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以从笼子里出去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.94,1:09:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后从这里出去的条件
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,或许就是五个人加起来要高潮100次
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.05,1:10:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,100次
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.15,1:10:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.62,1:10:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一开始
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.19,1:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,老公就可以出去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.56,1:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但太太没办法出去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.60,1:10:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.10,1:10:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能满足自己的老婆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.71,1:10:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下15小时要77次
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.09,1:10:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.23,1:10:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.13,1:10:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.86,1:10:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.83,1:10:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,太太真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.17,1:10:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只能请妳加油了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.87,1:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们男人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.80,1:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是有限度的
